## Notes
This slice ends with an active issue planner able to author drafts. Validated issue completion and execution handoff belong to issue 19. Fake-host tests verify the public boundary and prompt payload; they are not evidence of real native UI rendering. Installed-host and cross-platform evidence belongs to issue 25.

Legacy JSON generators, graph approval handlers and chat transport have been removed. All feature command entrypoints use native stage services. Unsupported saved workflows cannot resume or migrate; their artifacts remain intact.

